{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"この間未央奈とお仕事前に\nバケモノの子展に行ってきました！\n細田守監督の絵が好きです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"繊細な絵というか...\n私には到底書けません(^-^)/\nあれ？知ってるって？\n私の絵見ますか？え、見ます？\nあ、やめとく？あ...そうですか..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でもとにかくすごい！\n皆様も一回行ってみてください。\n心が洗われます(o^^o)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/miria.watanabe/img/miria.watanabe/img/2015/08/19/1026250/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/miria.watanabe/img/miria.watanabe/img/2015/08/19/1026250/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近はツアーなどがありますが\n私の中では何かと充実してます。\nでも行きたい所たくさん...\nメモ帳には行きたいリストを作って\n全部書いてます（笑）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/miria.watanabe/img/miria.watanabe/img/2015/08/19/1026250/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"浴衣着て花火大会とかお祭り行きたいです\n生写真の浴衣は少し\n渋めなのを選びました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/miria.watanabe/img/miria.watanabe/img/2015/08/19/1026250/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"月刊Auditionの時のチェキです。\n応募したらサイン入りチェキ\n貰えるそうなので\nぜひ応募してみてください(^ ^)♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"広島でのライブ終わりました！\n広島会場はお客さんの顔がよく\n見えて一人一人歌ってたり踊ってたり\n笑ってたりが見えて私も嬉しくなりました"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"揚げもみじ饅頭食べれなかったのが悔い..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"次は福岡です\n待っててね〜♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/miria.watanabe/img/miria.watanabe/img/2015/08/19/1026250/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みりり委員会お待たせしました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"また見てね"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みり愛"}],"source":"archive"}